args: opentide generate --help
exit: 0

━━━ stdout
Generate schemas, templates, docs and exports

Run with no argument for the full pipeline, or name one or more phases to run only those, in the order given: schemas, templates, vocabs, snippets.

Regenerate editor schemas without paying for documentation: `opentide generate schemas templates vocabs snippets`.

␛[1m␛[4mUsage:␛[0m ␛[1mopentide generate␛[0m [COMMAND]

␛[1m␛[4mCommands:␛[0m
  ␛[1mexplorer␛[0m  Write the explorer bundle and search index
  ␛[1mdocs␛[0m      Generate markdown documentation for detection objects
  ␛[1mexports␛[0m   Export catalogue artefacts
  ␛[1mextract␛[0m   Import rules from external platforms
  ␛[1minflight␛[0m  Inflight preview shard generation and prune

␛[1m␛[4mOptions:␛[0m
      ␛[1m--help␛[0m
          Print help

Examples:
  $ opentide generate
  $ opentide generate schemas templates

━━━ stderr · empty
